{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026F52CqfuYPU1795557971.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天氣概況：一股東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道雲帶亦覆蓋該區。</p><p></p><p>本港地區今日天氣預測：大致多雲。早晚清涼及有一兩陣微雨。日間部分時間天色明朗，最高氣溫約21度。吹和緩至清勁北至東北風，初時離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><p></p><p>展望：明早仍然清涼。隨後一兩日漸轉天晴乾燥，氣溫回升，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。</p><p></p><p>05:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:21.847644+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T22:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T01:37:13.223437+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T23:17:37.641551+00:00","content_hash":"5252fe63695a57781fb2e37dd601104a6a7ad9a70f8ce5983e85f439af991561","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T23:24:21.847644+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}